 <sect2 xml:id="migration86.new-functions.sodium">
  <title>Sodium</title>

  <simplelist>
   <member><function>sodium_crypto_ipcrypt_keygen</function></member>
   <member><function>sodium_crypto_ipcrypt_encrypt</function></member>
   <member><function>sodium_crypto_ipcrypt_decrypt</function></member>
   <member><function>sodium_crypto_ipcrypt_nd_keygen</function></member>
   <member><function>sodium_crypto_ipcrypt_nd_encrypt</function></member>
   <member><function>sodium_crypto_ipcrypt_nd_decrypt</function></member>
   <member><function>sodium_crypto_ipcrypt_ndx_keygen</function></member>
   <member><function>sodium_crypto_ipcrypt_ndx_encrypt</function></member>
   <member><function>sodium_crypto_ipcrypt_ndx_decrypt</function></member>
   <member><function>sodium_crypto_ipcrypt_pfx_keygen</function></member>
   <member><function>sodium_crypto_ipcrypt_pfx_encrypt</function></member>
   <member><function>sodium_crypto_ipcrypt_pfx_decrypt</function></member>
   <member><function>sodium_bin2ip</function></member>
   <member><function>sodium_ip2bin</function></member>
  </simplelist>

  <para>
   The following functions expose the X-Wing <acronym>KEM</acronym>
   (hybrid ML-KEM768+X25519, libsodium's recommended <acronym>KEM</acronym>).
   They are available when PHP is built against libsodium 1.0.22 or later.

   <simplelist>
    <member><function>sodium_crypto_kem_keypair</function></member>
    <member><function>sodium_crypto_kem_seed_keypair</function></member>
    <member><function>sodium_crypto_kem_secretkey</function></member>
    <member><function>sodium_crypto_kem_publickey</function></member>
    <member><function>sodium_crypto_kem_enc</function></member>
    <member><function>sodium_crypto_kem_dec</function></member>
   </simplelist>
  </para>

  <para>
   The following functions expose the ML-KEM768 (FIPS 203)
   <acronym>KEM</acronym>.
   They are available when PHP is built against libsodium 1.0.22 or later.

   <simplelist>
    <member><function>sodium_crypto_kem_mlkem768_keypair</function></member>
    <member><function>sodium_crypto_kem_mlkem768_seed_keypair</function></member>
    <member><function>sodium_crypto_kem_mlkem768_secretkey</function></member>
    <member><function>sodium_crypto_kem_mlkem768_publickey</function></member>
    <member><function>sodium_crypto_kem_mlkem768_enc</function></member>
    <member><function>sodium_crypto_kem_mlkem768_dec</function></member>
   </simplelist>
  </para>
 </sect2>

